1131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Watch in XR 3D: play any movie or episode on a virtual cinema screen with real depth, converted on the headset as it plays (Quest 3 and Quest 3S), or play real 3D films (side by side) natively on every headset.\r\n- Pick Comfort, Standard or Strong depth, and choose where you watch: Void, Passthrough or the Moonlit Field. Move and resize the screen; the 3D settings sit beside it while the film plays.\r\n- Download subtitles inside the headset, pick the one you want, and it turns on right away.\r\n- \"Continue in XR 3D\" from Continue Watching, on movies and episodes. Watch in 2D any time and the film carries on where you left it on the flat panel.\r\n- Sources you have put behind a VPN stream through it in the headset too.\r\n- New provider categories are flagged \"New\" instead of appearing silently: on Home, in the browse pickers and in Manage categories.\r\n- Lock any profile with a PIN, asked on every switch to that profile. \"Forgot PIN\" emails you a reset code.\r\n- Your OpenSubtitles login follows your account to every device. Sign out on one device or everywhere.", "created_date": 1789098250, "id": "28044848135180430", "version": "3.3.0", "version_code": 4114, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Watch in XR 3D: play any movie or episode on a virtual cinema screen with real depth, converted on the headset as it plays (Quest 3 and Quest 3S), or play real 3D films (side by side) natively on every headset.\r\n- Pick Comfort, Standard or Strong depth, and choose where you watch: Void, Passthrough or the Moonlit Field. Move and resize the screen; the 3D settings sit beside it while the film plays.\r\n- Download subtitles inside the headset, pick the one you want, and it turns on right away.\r\n- \"Continue in XR 3D\" from Continue Watching, on movies and episodes. Watch in 2D any time and the film carries on where you left it on the flat panel.\r\n- Sources you have put behind a VPN stream through it in the headset too.\r\n- New provider categories are flagged \"New\" instead of appearing silently: on Home, in the browse pickers and in Manage categories.\r\n- Lock any profile with a PIN, asked on every switch to that profile. \"Forgot PIN\" emails you a reset code.\r\n- Your OpenSubtitles login follows your account to every device. Sign out on one device or everywhere.", "created_date": 1789089010, "id": "28043331721998738", "version": "3.3.0", "version_code": 4109, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed a crash when closing the app while a video was playing.\r\nFixed a crash when searching or filtering Movies and Series on very large playlists.\r\nFixed a video engine issue that could freeze playback after 10 to 20 minutes of continuous viewing.\r\nLive channels start faster, switching is quicker, and a stalled stream recovers on its own.\r\nFixed a rare crash when switching channels. Playback no longer stops over a single decode glitch.\r\nThe progress bar slides smoothly, with a time bubble while you scrub.\r\nChannel logos fall back to our own logo service when your provider's are missing.\r\nHome loads faster, with Continue Watching first.\r\nA title removed from Continue Watching on one device no longer comes back from another.", "created_date": 1788499472, "id": "27954057797592798", "version": "3.2.2", "version_code": 4050, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "Added Stream VPN: route a playlist's streams through your own VPN (Proton VPN, Windscribe, Mullvad, or WireGuard).\r\nAdded team and player pages in Sports, plus Favorite Teams with their own rail.\r\nImproved channel switching: the old channel disconnects first, fixing buffering on single-connection playlists.\r\nImproved Home: the most important rows come first, and Continue Watching appears instantly.", "created_date": 1788153890, "id": "27899636533034925", "version": "3.2.0", "version_code": 4048, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "New\r\n- The home sports rail is now Top 10 Sports Events, ranked for the day.\r\n- Home rails show one card per title instead of one per language or quality.\r\n\r\nImproved\r\n- The home banner cross-dissolves between titles and no longer stutters when it loops.\r\n- The Guide opens on the category your provider lists first, and remembers the one you used last.\r\n- Channel previews in the Guide fade in instead of flashing black.\r\n- Top TV Channels shows proper channel logos.\r\n- Episode names and descriptions follow the app language.\r\n- Darker theme: black content area with a lighter sidebar.\r\n\r\nFixed\r\n- Continue Watching no longer shows a barely-watched title as finished.\r\n- Fixed a crash in Sports Hub when the posts carousel appeared.", "created_date": 1787618659, "id": "27821341417531104", "version": "3.1.29", "version_code": 4045, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}